EN:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}Where have you guys been?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I've been waiting and waiting
for you!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}¿Dónde habéis estado?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡He estado esperando y esperando
a que vinierais de una vez!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}Ben où vous étiez ?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ça fait des lustres que je vous
attends !{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}Wo seid ihr denn abgeblieben?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ich hab die ganze Zeit auf euch
gewartet!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Non mi avrai mica mandato a
chiamare per farmi una lavata
di capo, {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}! Vero?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}You must have some important
stuff to talk about if you wanted
me to come over, {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}Seguro que tienes algo muy
importante que decirme si me
has hecho venir, {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}Deve essere qualcosa di davvero
importante se mi hai fatto fare
tutta questa strada, {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}Es muss ja wichtig sein, wenn ich
extra dafür vorbeikommen sollte,
{{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Ah,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡solo quería devolverte{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} esa
cosilla que me habías prestado!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Perdona que me la quedase
tanto tiempo,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Oh,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} volevo solo restituirti questa{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
cosa che avevo preso in prestito!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Scusami se non te l'ho ridata prima,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Ach ja!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ich wollte dir das hier
wiedergeben.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Tut mir leid, dass ich es so lange
ausgeliehen hatte,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Aa,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} senden ödünç aldığım şu şeyi geri
vermek istedim!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bu kadar uzun süre bende kaldığı
için kusura bakma,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}}A huh huh.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Remember that thing you
were looking for?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I found one, so I
bought it for you! {{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Ejem...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¿Recuerdas aquello que
estabas buscando?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Pues lo he
encontrado, ¡y te lo he comprado!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Hé hé...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Tu te souviens de cette
chose que tu voulais ?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Eh bien
regarde ce que j'ai trouvé ! {{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Ah ah.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ti ricordi di quella cosa che
stavi cercando?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} L'ho trovata e l'ho
comprata apposta per te!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Hı hı hı.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Aradığın şu şeyi hatırlıyor
musun?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Bir tane bulunca
senin için aldım! {{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}I just had a nightmare where you
ate up every last {{TAG:0005:001A:00CD}}
in town!
{{TAG:0003:0014:}}It was a scary dream,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} but I thought
you should know about it,
{{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}He soñado que te ibas comiendo
cada {{TAG:0005:001A:00CD}} del pueblo
hasta que ya no quedaban.
{{TAG:0003:0014:}}Ha sido una pesadilla espantosa,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡pero tenía que contártela,
{{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Ho appena fatto un incubo terribile:
tu mangiavi ogni {{TAG:0005:001A:00CD}}
della nostra città!
{{TAG:0003:0014:}}Che brutto sogno!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ma ho pensato
fosse il caso di dirtelo, {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Mi è giunta voce che vogliono aprire{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
un chiosco di {{TAG:0005:0013:0000}}
in Via degli Acquisti.
Tu ne sapevi qualcosa,
{{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ana Cadde’de {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0005:0013:0000}} satan bir tezgâh
açılacağına dair bir söylenti duydum.
Sen bir şey biliyor musun,{{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}Aa doğru,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ben de bir tezgâh lafı duydum.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}
Ama{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} galiba {{TAG:0005:000E:0000}} satacakmış.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0028:}}Gerçi
boşuna konuşuyoruz; tezgâh işi tamamen
iptal edilmiş.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Tüh ya.

DE:
Ich muss jetzt los, {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Ich hab 'ne Verabredung mit einer
großen Portion {{TAG:0005:0010:0000}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0003:}}Danke fürs Abholen, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Lass dich dafür mit einem Geschenk
belohnen, ja?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:0020:}}Bis dann!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}Tamam, ben kaçıyorum artık,{{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}
{{TAG:0000:0004:}}.{{TAG:0003:0004:}}{{TAG:0005:0010:0000}}Evde biraz {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ile planım var,{{TAG:0005:0007:}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}.{{TAG:000C:0002:}}
{{TAG:000C:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}Beni almaya geldiğin için sağ
ol; zahmetine karşılık hediyeni
de almayı unutma, {{TAG:0007:0001:}}!{{TAG:0003:0020:}} Görüşürüz!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ich glaube, wir sind hier fertig.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Ich mach mich dann mal auf den
Weg, {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0020:}}Tschüss!

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0003:}}Looks like we're all finished here.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
So see you around, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}I'm going to have a snack now,
{{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}. You should too.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
You're probably starving.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0003:}}Galiba burada işimiz tamam.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Sonra görüşürüz, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Ben şimdi
bir şeyler atıştıracağım,
{{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}. Sen de ye.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Kesin acıkmışsındır.
